Hi Volunteers!

We continue to work on Desolate, and today we’ve released another update, in which we’ve fixed a few in-game bugs and made some useful improvements.


 Reworked the system of enemies’ appearance in the open world. Now the respawn does not occur in the presence of the player;
 Fixed the respawn of Alpha Sapsy in the hunt mission;
 Updated Stone Throwing Animations;
 Fixed context animations when hitting an enemy with a modified weapon;
 Reworked the balance of melee weapons that have no modifications;
 Fixed a bug with the interface in the character menu that prevented you from clicking the "Use" button. 


Thank you for the feedback you give! It helps us make Desolate better. If you've witnessed a bug, please let us know in the comments under this news or on our Discord: https://discord.gg/qwWQwZep

Hi Volunteers!

We continue to improve Desolate, and today we’ve released another update. We've upgraded the customization and some other aspects of the game - a total of more than 10 changes and improvements in the patch.

Customization

In this update, we updated the appearance of the game characters to make them look more realistic.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29823087/b35c2def3a42dff1fd6bed480a88918cabc6105d.png

Desolate now has new hairstyles, new facial models and hair tones! We hope this will help you create more unique and interesting volunteers.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29823087/b6374b2cbf67094421c4142c4a8f284712ff329c.png

Bugfixes

That's not all! We've fixed several in-game bugs at once. Check this out:


 fixed the blocking hit animation - now the animation works correctly if you crouch down and stand up;
 fixed a bug related to Vanogh's boss kill;
 Fixed a bug with the Butcher that caused some players to freeze and crash;
 fixed the bug with the infinite hit animation after using the energy cell;
 updated icons in the customization window;
 fixed Spanish subtitles in the start room;
 fixed a rare bug where animal models were "flying around" in the sky;
 several bugs that led to crashes have been fixed;
 The Tab key can now be assigned in the settings to be used to bring up the inventory;
 Both sprint modes now work correctly, which can be set in the settings (Tap shift / Press Shift);
 Boxes are no longer signed as empty if they have items in them.


We will continue to work on Desolate and update the game. If you have witnessed an in-game bug, please let us know about it on Discord: https://discord.gg/ygSKN7QT

Hello, Volunteers,

We continue to improve Desolate and fix in-game bugs that sometimes prevent you from playing comfortably. In today's bugfix:


 Kick is added to the in-game settings and can now be reassigned to any key;
 Fixed bugs with Spartan and Viking perks;
 Fixed a bug where the game would crash if the Madman hit the bonfire;
 Fixed visual glitches on the character status screen;


We will continue to work on Desolate and update the game. If you have witnessed an in-game bug, please let us know about it on Discord: https://discord.gg/TsJXJcyZ

Hello, Volunteers,

Thanks to your feedback, we’ve found and fixed several in-game bugs in Desolate:


 Fixed a bug where the player would lose control during melee fight in cooperative play;
 Fixed a bug where the user would end up in the safe zone instead of the location where they had saved before after loading in the cooperative game;
 Fixed several bugs that caused the game to crash or fail to launch; 

We will continue to work on Desolate and update the game. If you have witnessed an in-game bug, please let us know about it on Discord: https://discord.gg/bgq5JxZA
